{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le06ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "I just attended a great workshop on r\u00e9sum\u00e9 writing. The notes that I took are copious and I'm summarizing them here so that you can benefit from what I learned. It is assumed to be easy to write a r\u00e9sum\u00e9, but it can be a challenge. There is a lot of work to be done. You need to think about these things before you sit down to write your r\u00e9sum\u00e9. Give yourself some time. Your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 needs to be a reflection of who you are and what you can do, so really contemplate those elements of yourself.", "id": 1, "time": "30", "image": "engenn9le06ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Many different styles of r\u00e9sum\u00e9s are reported to be used, but all r\u00e9sum\u00e9s need to include four basic elements. Information about who you are, your name and contact information, is recommended to be included in the first section. Next, you need to include what you want, or your job objective. It's good to have this near the top of your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 so that potential employers can see right away if your needs correspond with theirs. The next section should be about what you know. This section is expected to include details about your skills, qualifications, and work experience. The last section covers your education, which is to be listed in reverse chronological order.", "id": 2, "time": "28000", "image": "engenn9le06ob07re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "Before you start writing, you should brainstorm your experience and skills. Make a list of your accomplishments and write down action verbs. Next, the type of r\u00e9sum\u00e9 is to be considered. There are three basic types. R\u00e9sum\u00e9s can be set up chronologically, functionally, or with a combination of both. When a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 is in chronological order it focuses on work experience. Your professional experience is listed in chronological order starting from your latest experience, back. Functional r\u00e9sum\u00e9s concentrate on skills. A combination r\u00e9sum\u00e9 is perfect if you are a first-time job seeker. It allows you to show any professional experience, while also allowing you to draw attention to any skills you have. This is especially important since, if you are just starting out, you will have limited work experience.", "id": 3, "time": "70000", "image": "engenn9le06ob07re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le06ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le06ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can explain what to consider before writing a r\u00e9sum\u00e9. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about general issues related to a job search.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What should you do before you start writing your r\u00e9sum\u00e9?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "  What do you know about the different types and styles of r\u00e9sum\u00e9s?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " I can talk about events and experiences related to a job.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "t